      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.47,
      "end_seconds": 10.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "that's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 11.27,
      "end_seconds": 22.42,
      "duration_seconds": 11.15,
      "text": "I mean, hello, doctor. I hope it's alright if I stay in for this. Actually, we came because of mood swings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.09,
      "end_seconds": 26.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "How much does it limit you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.44,
      "end_seconds": 49.64,
      "duration_seconds": 17.2,
      "text": "A seven out of ten, uh, I suppose. Actually, I've had poor sleep too, for about three months. I had hot flushes before. That's settled now, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.76,
      "end_seconds": 55.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "any bleeding after sex, weight loss or very heavy bleeding?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.3,
      "end_seconds": 63.22,
      "duration_seconds": 6.92,
      "text": "No bleeding after sex, weight loss or very heavy bleeding, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.64,
      "end_seconds": 72.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "alright, did you notice any pelvic pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.79,
      "end_seconds": 77.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "No. No pelvic pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.43,
      "end_seconds": 85.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.26,
      "end_seconds": 90.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "So, bowels are regular, nothing odd."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.1,
      "end_seconds": 94.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.71,
      "end_seconds": 99.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "uh, nothing, I haven't had any operations"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.09,
      "end_seconds": 105.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.13,
      "end_seconds": 121.99,
      "duration_seconds": 14.86,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother. I look after my grandchildren most days. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.68,
      "end_seconds": 126.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.21,
      "end_seconds": 139.67,
      "duration_seconds": 11.46,
      "text": "Yeah, I think I reacted to some antibiotic once, years ago. I don't remember which one, or what happened exactly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.72,
      "end_seconds": 147.26,
      "duration_seconds": 6.54,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 148.21,
      "end_seconds": 153.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.88,
      "text": "Mm, it's mirtazapine, 15 milligrams, at night, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.78,
      "end_seconds": 161.79,
      "duration_seconds": 7.01,
      "text": "yeah, uh, I'd been on escitalopram, not any more though, I stopped"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.58,
      "end_seconds": 169.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "So, anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.85,
      "end_seconds": 177.77,
      "duration_seconds": 6.92,
      "text": "I've had depression for two years now. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.29,
      "end_seconds": 189.65,
      "duration_seconds": 7.36,
      "text": "Yes, depression is known to us, good to have that clear. Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.29,
      "end_seconds": 204.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.28,
      "end_seconds": 220.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "Okay: temperature 36.5, pulse 81, BP is 124 over 78."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.56,
      "end_seconds": 223.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.65,
      "end_seconds": 226.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "that's fine, I'll explain it soon"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.97,
      "end_seconds": 233.19,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.14,
      "end_seconds": 235.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.36,
      "end_seconds": 258.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "Your blood pressure is normal and the abdomen is soft."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.23,
      "end_seconds": 266.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Right, that's the examination finished."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.66,
      "end_seconds": 291.52,
      "duration_seconds": 8.86,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, it points towards perimenopause. Another possibility is a thyroid problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.82,
      "end_seconds": 334.96,
      "duration_seconds": 29.14,
      "text": "I think a thyroid test makes sense here, for hot flushes i'm sending you for a blood count because of irregular periods you'll be taking estradiol gel, 1 pump, once a day, long term it's for menopausal symptoms regular exercise, light layers and and avoiding triggers can help i'll want another look in three months have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.1,
      "end_seconds": 342.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
